Subject: [PATCH 5/5] crypto: sun4i-ss: register the Allwinner V821 variant

Describe the V821 SHA byte order and bind its crypto-engine device-tree
compatible to the sun4i-ss driver after the generic engine and DMA support
have been applied.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [V821 variant registration]

---
--- a/drivers/crypto/allwinner/sun4i-ss/sun4i-ss-core.c
+++ b/drivers/crypto/allwinner/sun4i-ss/sun4i-ss-core.c
@@ -29,6 +30,10 @@
 
 static const struct ss_variant ss_a33_variant = {
 	.sha1_in_be = true,
 };
 
+static const struct ss_variant ss_v821_variant = {
+	.sha1_in_be = false,
+};
+
 static struct sun4i_ss_alg_template ss_algs[] = {
@@ -512,4 +593,7 @@
 static const struct of_device_id a20ss_crypto_of_match_table[] = {
+	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun300i-v821-crypto",
+	  .data = &ss_v821_variant
+	},
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun4i-a10-crypto",
 	  .data = &ss_a10_variant
 	},
